<newsitem itemid="659354" id="root" date="1997-06-13" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: HSI Services launches 32-company China-play index.</title>
<headline>HSI Services launches 32-company China-play index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>HSI Services Ltd, the compiler of Hong Kong's Hang Seng blue chip index, said on Friday it would launch a 32-company, China-affiliated corporations index on June 16.  </p>
<p>HSI Services said the index would comprise:</p>
<p>China Aerospace International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>China Everbright International Ltd</p>
<p>China Foods Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>China Merchants Holdings (International) Co Ltd</p>
<p>China Overseas Land &amp; Investment Ltd  </p>
<p>China Pharmaceutical Enterprise &amp; Investment Corp Ltd</p>
<p>China Resources Enterprise Ltd</p>
<p>China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd  </p>
<p>CNPC (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>Continental Mariner Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>COSCO Pacific Ltd</p>
<p>Denway Investment Ltd</p>
<p>Founder (Hong Kong) Ltd  </p>
<p>Guangdong Investment Ltd</p>
<p>Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd</p>
<p>Hualing Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Ka Wah Bank Ltd  </p>
<p>Legend Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Ng Fung Hong Ltd</p>
<p>ONFEM Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Oriental Metals (Holdings) Co Ltd</p>
<p>Poly Investment Holdings Ltd  </p>
<p>Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Shenyin Wanguo (H.K.) Ltd</p>
<p>Shougang Concord Century Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Shougang Concord Grand (Group) Ltd</p>
<p>Shougang Concord International Enterprises Co Ltd  </p>
<p>Shougang Concord Technology Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Stone Electronic Technology Ltd</p>
<p>Top Glory International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Union Bank of Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
